### Concurrent titles: part-time employment + own firm
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculations/insurance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employment": {"base": "2000.00", "atLeastMinimumWage": false},
  "selfEmployment": {"base": "4877.11", "voluntarySickness": true, "debt": "0.00"}
}

### Benefit base from Z-3 (skipped month left out)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculations/benefit-base
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "EMPLOYMENT",
  "fullTime": true,
  "months": [{"amount": "6000.00"}, {"amount": "6000.00"}, {"amount": "1500.00", "skip": true}]
}
